# ─── What stays OUT of git ────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependencies (resolved at `npm install` time on each clone — not source)
node_modules/

# Build artifacts that aren't part of the shipped plugin
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log

# Editor + OS scratch
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Secrets — NEVER commit these
.swarmy-token
.swarmy-user-key
.faerie-token
.env
.env.local

# ─── What STAYS in git ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# (Not gitignored — listed here as documentation only)
#
# manifest.json    — Obsidian reads this; required in release
# main.js          — the built bundle; users install this directly
# main.ts, src/    — source so developers can rebuild
# styles.css       — plugin CSS, loaded by Obsidian at runtime
# package.json     — declares build scripts + devDependencies
# package-lock.json — locks build-time deps for reproducible CI builds
# esbuild.config.mjs, tsconfig.json — build configuration
# Blueprints/, templates/, presets/ — content bundled with the plugin
# README.md, INSTALL.md, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, TUTORIAL.md, LICENSE
